# (build 112b) The Escape menu over the attract sequence: the title and the
# crawl across Motavia play on under it, in time with their music, which the
# menu never stopped (The owner: the music came out of step with the title's
# crawl). The pad is withheld from the game while the menu is open, so the
# title runs out its wait ($6CC frames after the two dissolves) and moves on
# to the crawl exactly as if nobody touched it. Before 112b the menu froze the
# title where it was opened, and it was still there when the menu closed.
start new
sound render on
wait screen title
wait ticks 60
press esc
expect escape-menu open
wait ticks 400
shot title_dissolving_under_menu
expect screen title
wait ticks 2400
expect screen level
shot crawl_under_menu
expect sound playing
press b
expect escape-menu closed
expect screen level
